    "detailed_description": "Shatter your opponent's defenses and set them up for earthshaking super attacks!<br><br>Shattered is a 1-on-1 fighting game inspired by the greats of the \u201990s. A ground based footsies fighter with 4 button controls, where you aim to shatter your opponent to grant you more options to dish out damage.<br><br>All this is presented in a beautifully crafted pixelart environment featuring top-notch animations! Play against your friends online via rollback netplay or dive into the story of worlds shattering and civilisations breaking.<br><br>Follow Julia, Ushah, Roxanne, Azar and others on their race against an infinite number of apocalypses threatening everything they hold dear.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Characters</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Julia: This reality hopping curator of infernal artifacts is a true jack of all trades.<br></li><li>Ushah: A warrior monk with unmatched power. Grab hold of your enemies with his powerful metal arm or hose them down with scalding steam.<br></li><li>Roxanne: On a mission to redeem her many past mistakes before her time runs out. A true defensive bulwark who can lash out with gunpowder justice.<br></li><li>Azar: This construct of unknowable power can switch from a methodical projectile shooting mode, to the powerful rushdown overdrive mode.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357810/extras/c2eeb2e9de3e05979b0b420c7c0ece5d.avif?t=1680813165\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Shattering</h2>Pressuring your opponent with overwhelming force breaks eventually breaks their body and will. The perfect chance to grab the moment in the fight!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357810/extras/bd4ed49057ea279aa3926801e36727db.poster.avif?t=1680813165\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357810/extras/bd4ed49057ea279aa3926801e36727db.webm?t=1680813165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357810/extras/bd4ed49057ea279aa3926801e36727db.mp4?t=1680813165\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Specialized shatter attacks can aid you in your mission to shatter your rivals.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357810/extras/c05039d86c49f03932af03d6cfbe1c17.poster.avif?t=1680813165\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357810/extras/c05039d86c49f03932af03d6cfbe1c17.webm?t=1680813165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357810/extras/c05039d86c49f03932af03d6cfbe1c17.mp4?t=1680813165\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Shattering your opponent opens up powerful Shatter Supers that deal massive damage.",
